    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1085">

                <pb facs="1272" n="1076" xml:id="pg1076"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760h.68/7–2845: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1085<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-31">July 31 [1945.]</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>167. Department is instructing Embassies Moscow and London to inform FonOffs of
                    our recommendation of appointment of tripartite commission in accordance with
                    urtel <hi rendition="#small-caps">Victory</hi> 392, July 28,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d1085-f1"/> and to solicit indication by FonOffs of agreement of
                    Soviet and British Governments to collaborate in this matter.</p>
                <closer><signed>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
